<title>MEXICO: Mexican markets, banks closed for national holiday.</title>
<headline>Mexican markets, banks closed for national holiday.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican financial markets, banks and exchange houses are closed Friday for a national holiday.</p>
<p>The holiday is in honor of Benito Juarez, a much revered 19th century president.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
